VERSION 2
RULE baseline.dotnet.core.stack_trace_or_error_disclosure VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "(?i)\\b(?:Response\\s*\\.\\s*Write(?:Async)?|Content|BadRequest|Problem|Json|Results\\s*\\.\\s*(?:Problem|BadRequest|Json))\\s*\\([^;\\n]{0,240}\\b(?:\\w+\\s*\\.\\s*(?:StackTrace|ToString\\s*\\(|Message)|ExceptionDetails)" "im"
REPORT "Error Detail Disclosure Review"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
